<title>UK: London sugar freight sees inquiry.</title>
<headline>London sugar freight sees inquiry.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genoc had 13,500/14,000 bagged sugar E C Mexico /E Africa, Madagascar, Red Sea or Indian Ocean and 20/22,000 bulk Thailand//Novorossisk prompt.</p>
<p>Brokers said that rumoured fixed were Genoc 14,000 loose and/or bagged Santos/Med or Black Sea 2/12 Jan and 19,700/20,300 bulk Santos /Maputo May/June and Vitol 20,000 min/max bulk Maceio/Black Sea prompt.</p>
</text>
